      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uncoated Nb–Mo–Ta–W refractory HEA exhibits impact-induced energy release.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated alloy has limited ductility and non-uniform deformation because cracks initiate at its surface.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 2–5 μm Zr-based metallic-glass coating can be deposited on Nb–Mo–Ta–W HEA by magnetron sputtering.",
