      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4510962::web::014::sample_preparation_and_characterization"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keeping the substrate below 300 °C will guarantee that the Zr-based coating is fully amorphous.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial pretreatment or an interlayer will provide robust adhesion between the metallic glass and Nb–Mo–Ta–W HEA.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will produce a continuous, uniform, adherent, and ductile metallic-glass surface layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Amorphous HEA films can combine high strength with excellent plasticity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9735962::web::010::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plastic deformation in amorphous alloys is localized in nanoscale shear bands rather than mediated by dislocations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9735962::web::010::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ductile shear bands can control stable plastic flow in amorphous alloys.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9735962::web::010::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The metallic-glass coating will redistribute applied stress at the HEA surface.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will suppress localized surface-crack nucleation and propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing surface cracking will prevent premature or catastrophic failure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Low-temperature coating deposition will leave the refractory HEA core unaltered.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to uncoated material, the coated HEA will have significantly greater tensile ductility.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to uncoated material, the coated HEA will deform more uniformly during dynamic impact.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will maintain the yield strength of the uncoated Nb–Mo–Ta–W baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will maintain the impact-induced energy release of the uncoated baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
